  "name": "Example: Solving Equations Containing an Expression Raised to an Even Power",
  "problem": "Find all of the real solutions to the equation $(x-3)^4=-\\dfrac{1}{81}.$",
  "worked_solution": "Notice that $(x-3)^4 \\geq 0$ for all values of $x$ because the exponent ($4$) is even. This expression can never be negative. \n\nTherefore, there are no real solutions to this equation.",
